---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { ProjectBriefForm } from "../components/ProjectBriefForm";
---

<Layout
  title="Evonera Technologies — Software Engineering & Web Development"
  description="Evonera Technologies turns ambitious ideas, prototypes, and stuck AI projects into fast, production-grade web apps and websites."
>
  <section class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 pt-20 sm:pt-28 pb-20">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-500/20 text-blue-300 text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">
        <span class="size-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>
        Evonera Technologies · Software Engineering Studio
      </div>
      <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl sm:text-6xl font-semibold text-neutral-50 tracking-tight leading-[1.08] text-balance">
        From prototype to production.<br class="hidden sm:block" />
        <span class="text-blue-300">We build software that ships.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-base sm:text-lg text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed">
        We help founders and teams take web apps across the finish line: build clean full-stack features, resolve tricky bugs, connect backends and payments, and untangle AI-generated code so you can launch with confidence.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a href="#project-review" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-blue-600 px-6 py-3.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-blue-500 transition-colors shadow-lg shadow-blue-600/20">
          Tell us what you’re building <span aria-hidden="true" class="ml-2">→</span>
        </a>
        <a href="#how-it-works" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-white/20 bg-ink-900 px-6 py-3.5 text-sm font-medium text-neutral-100 hover:bg-ink-800 transition-colors">
          How we work
        </a>
        <a href="/services" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-ink-950 px-6 py-3.5 text-sm font-medium text-neutral-300 hover:text-white hover:bg-ink-900 transition-colors">
          Services & pricing
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-10 pt-8 border-t border-white/10 grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-6 max-w-xl">
        <div>
          <p class="text-xs font-mono text-neutral-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Scoping</p>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm font-medium text-neutral-200">Fixed price before work starts</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-xs font-mono text-neutral-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Ownership</p>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm font-medium text-neutral-200">100% your code & deployment</p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-span-2 sm:col-span-1">
          <p class="text-xs font-mono text-neutral-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Speed</p>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm font-medium text-neutral-200">Direct review within 24 hours</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-y border-white/10 bg-ink-900" aria-labelledby="rescue-title">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-16 sm:py-20">
      <div class="max-w-2xl">
        <p class="text-sm font-medium text-blue-300">A practical handoff from prototype to product</p>
        <h2 id="rescue-title" class="mt-3 text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-semibold text-neutral-50">Make the app work beyond the demo.</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed">We start by understanding what you have and what you need next. Then we focus the work on the blockers that are keeping you from shipping.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-px border border-white/10 bg-ink-800">
        <article class="bg-ink-900 p-6">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-neutral-100">Finish features</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed">Complete key flows that are only partly built or still using placeholder data.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="bg-ink-900 p-6">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-neutral-100">Fix bugs</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed">Trace issues across the generated code and repair the parts that keep breaking.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="bg-ink-900 p-6">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-neutral-100">Connect the backend</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed">Set up the data, authentication, integrations, or payments your app actually needs.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="bg-ink-900 p-6">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-neutral-100">Prepare to launch</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed">Help you deploy the app, connect your domain, and understand the handoff.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-5 text-xs text-neutral-400">The right technical approach depends on the project. We review your setup before recommending changes.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="how-it-works" class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-16 sm:py-20">
    <div class="max-w-2xl">
      <p class="text-sm font-medium text-blue-300">How it works</p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-semibold text-neutral-50">A clear next step, before a big commitment.</h2>
    </div>
    <ol class="mt-9 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <li class="border-t-2 border-blue-400 pt-5">
        <span class="text-sm font-mono text-blue-300">01</span>
        <h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-100">Share the project</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-300">Tell us which builder you used, share a link if you can, and describe what is unfinished.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="border-t-2 border-red-400 pt-5">
        <span class="text-sm font-mono text-red-300">02</span>
        <h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-100">Review the scope</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-300">We discuss the code, the blockers, and the outcome you want before proposing paid work.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="border-t-2 border-yellow-400 pt-5">
        <span class="text-sm font-mono text-yellow-300">03</span>
        <h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-100">Agree and build</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-300">You get a defined scope, price, and delivery plan to approve before work starts.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-ink-900 border-y border-white/10">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12 flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-6">
      <div>
        <p class="text-sm font-medium text-red-300">Pricing</p>
        <h2 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-semibold text-neutral-50">Scope first. Fixed quote before we start.</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-300">Small, well-defined fixes may start around $500 USD. Larger or unclear projects need a code review and a custom scope.</p>
      </div>
      <a href="/pricing" class="shrink-0 inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-yellow-300/50 bg-ink-950 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-neutral-100 hover:border-yellow-200 transition-colors">How pricing works</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="project-review" class="border-t border-white/10 bg-ink-950 px-4 sm:px-6 py-16 sm:py-20">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
      <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center mb-8">
        <p class="text-sm font-medium text-blue-300">Start with your project</p>
        <h2 class="mt-2 text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-semibold text-neutral-50">Tell us what you want to build or finish.</h2>
      </div>
      <ProjectBriefForm client:load />
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
